 src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250325/981167272871727104930256.jpeg/sgalzX8H7_IxM4bCPxccw6YjQ-YlO5lEElkIQxJZCEM\"/><figcaption>金在中（IG@jj_1986_jj）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金在中（IG@jj_1986_jj）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250325/981167276139220992750314.jpeg/tgVVEqfrE2sxOyj1TV9B0Pm9KEaD_UkRqPYo7aj2KO0\"/><figcaption>金在中（IG@jj_1986_jj）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金在中（IG@jj_1986_jj）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250325/981167278010011648178249.jpeg/5Vr3Lg8Xedliutj4l-CTjoJuAPZ3lDJm8OOJx_Djicc\"/><figcaption>金在中（IG@jj_1986_jj）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金在中（IG@jj_1986_jj）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250325/981167279926939648867409.jpeg/s30fPHbXqTKEbL7FVpEMihVBXenAnHqIdHltUnR5bVI\"/><figcaption>金在中（IG@jj_1986_jj）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金在中（IG@jj_1986_jj）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250325/981167268450799616523417.jpeg/nmknxLmdXEw0_iirAlMEpaL2cD6cHKZ5_7kP7v-5D-4\"/><figcaption>金在中（IG@jj_1986_jj）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金在中（IG@jj_1986_jj）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250325/981167270820712448634275.jpeg/izXHpfoShaLuxFzoRPf65SytvcTv5uvIt9qmj7fapo8\"/><figcaption>金在中（IG@jj_1986_jj）</figcaption></figure><p>金在中拒與生父見面！長大才知「3歲被領養」　認難放下：原諒一個人很難</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-03T15:25:57.530471+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1557,"images":36,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}